n signposted.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2ccf13d3-0da0-55fa-98c5-ba4329f840e3"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.05.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.05.010","content_hash":"1ae1255d83022ca85173c643d61810920500c6f4834efbdebe2c730993794a4e","heading":null,"ordinal":15,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.05.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.05.010:block:15","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.05.010","text":"(3) “No standing zones” means portions of streets designated by the Transportation Operations Superintendent as zones within which standing or stopping is prohibited at all times or at stated times when signposted.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"31734cd0-4c1e-5fb9-b899-d70c6021618e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.05.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.05.010","content_hash":"58476792139ba1c746eb63d8a0c4db4c4fafbeebe43d6dc3aef21c34192ef8a5","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.05.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.05.010:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.05.010","text":"(4) “Passenger curb loading zone” means a place adjacent to a curb reserved for the exclusive use of vehicles during the loading or unloading of passengers.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"78a013d0-e7fc-50ce-b25e-5a174bd70572"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.05.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.05.010","content_hash":"3d453846ce646776f47017d7b68c72b8e28a7b80b4092dc81446147a20ae1e8d","heading":null,"ordinal":17,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.05.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_c